OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1786630729
OL,3,CPopular Bristol bridge inaccessible
OL,4,Cdue to apparent structural issue
OL,6,FA popular footbridge spanning
OL,7,FBristol's floating harbour is
OL,8,Finaccessible with pictures appearing
OL,9,Fto show a structural malfunction.
OL,11,FPero's Bridge, which spans St
OL,12,FAugustine's Reach, has been cordoned
OL,13,Foff while a team inspect the situation.
OL,15,FA spokesperson for Bristol City
OL,16,FCouncil said: "Pero's Bridge is
OL,17,Fcurrently closed to pedestrians, and
OL,18,Fboats are unable to pass underneath.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/3
