OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1786630729
OL,3,CPopular Bristol bridge inaccessible
OL,4,Cdue to apparent structural issue
OL,6,F"If you're travelling through the
OL,7,Farea, please use an alternative route.
OL,8,FFerry passengers planning to board at
OL,9,Fthe City Centre landing at Cascade
OL,10,FSteps should use an alternative ferry
OL,11,Flanding.
OL,13,F"Our engineers are assessing the issue
OL,14,Fand working to restore normal
OL,15,Foperation as quickly as possible.
OL,17,F"Thank you for your patience and
OL,18,Funderstanding while we work to resolve
OL,19,Fthe problem. We will provide further
OL,20,Fupdates as soon as they are available."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/3
