OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1786630729
OL,3,CPopular Bristol bridge inaccessible
OL,4,Cdue to apparent structural issue
OL,6,FThe bridge, designed by the Irish
OL,7,Fartist Eilis O'Connell, opened in 1999
OL,8,Fand can be opened to allow tall boats
OL,9,Fto pass along the floating harbour.
OL,11,FIt is known for its distinctive horn-
OL,12,Fshaped sculptures which act as
OL,13,Fcounterweights for the lifting section.
